Question: Given a drug SMILES string, predict whether it
(A) is not toxic (B) is toxic
Drug SMILES: COc1ccc(CC2c3cc(OC)c(OC)cc3CC[N+]2(C)CCC(=O)OCCCCCOC(=O)CC[N+]2(C)CCc3cc(OC)c(OC)cc3C2Cc2ccc(OC)c(OC)c2)cc1OC
